<title>SPAIN: Spain to approve electricity framework next week.</title>
<headline>Spain to approve electricity framework next week.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain will &quot;certainly&quot; approve a new framework for the electricity industry next week, government spokesman Miguel Angel Rodriguez told journalists.</p>
<p>&quot;Certainly next week, and in any case before two weeks are up, the government will sign the new electricity framework,&quot; Rodriguez said.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
